  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can stomp your hooves with such force that it can knock a foe off-balance. If you can move and are able to stomp one of your feet on the ground, you can Trip a target on the ground within 10 feet of you with a stomp. In addition, your hoof unarmed attack’s damage die increases by one step to 1d8 damage.</span></p>"
